{
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "uid": "memory-sizing",
  "title": "Memory sizing",
  "tags": ["memory", "resources"],
  "time": { "from": "now-14d", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(workload_container:memory_real:max_bytes, namespace)", "refId": "namespace" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      },
      {
        "name": "window",
        "label": "Window",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "7d,14d,21d",
        "options": [
          { "text": "7d", "value": "7d", "selected": false },
          { "text": "14d", "value": "14d", "selected": true },
          { "text": "21d", "value": "21d", "selected": false }
        ],
        "current": { "text": "14d", "value": "14d" }
      },
      {
        "name": "workload",
        "label": "Workload",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(workload_container:memory_real:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, workload)", "refId": "workload" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 5 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Our sizing rule (`kubernetes/components/kyverno/README.md`), per container over **$window**: the **request** is the p95 of real memory (working set minus active file cache), rounded up to 16 MiB; the **limit** is twice the working set's p95 or the highest working set of the last 30 days x 1.1, whichever is higher, rounded up to 32 MiB. Pods of one workload are folded into one row by their maximum; a container that has not run within the window (a Job, a CronJob between runs) has no row. **Now / rule** below 0.8 means the request is too small, above 1.5 that it holds back more than the container uses. The series are recorded since this dashboard was added (`memory-sizing.yaml`), so a window longer than that holds less than it says; the window must be long enough to contain the rare peaks (a nightly job, a weekly cleanup). Containers with no request or limit of their own get Kyverno's defaults (32Mi / 128Mi). **VPA target / lower / upper bound** are the VPA recommender's figures (p90 of daily peaks of the working set + 15 %; Goldilocks shows the same) - a second opinion, wide in its first ~8 days; Jobs and CronJobs have none."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Request and limit per container",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 24, "h": 20 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "max by (namespace, workload, workload_type, container) (workload_container:memory_request:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"})" },
        { "refId": "B", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "ceil(quantile_over_time(0.95, workload_container:memory_real:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]) / 16777216) * 16777216" },
        { "refId": "C", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "workload_container:memory_request:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"} / (ceil(quantile_over_time(0.95, workload_container:memory_real:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window]) / 16777216) * 16777216)" },
        { "refId": "D", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "max by (namespace, workload, workload_type, container) (workload_container:memory_limit:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"})" },
        { "refId": "E", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "ceil(((2 * quantile_over_time(0.95, workload_container:memory_working_set:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])) > (1.1 * max_over_time(workload_container:memory_working_set:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[30d])) or (1.1 * max_over_time(workload_container:memory_working_set:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[30d]))) / 33554432) * 33554432" },
        { "refId": "F", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, workload_container:memory_real:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])" },
        { "refId": "G", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, workload_container:memory_working_set:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])" },
        { "refId": "H", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "max_over_time(workload_container:memory_working_set:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$window])" },
        { "refId": "I", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "max by (namespace, workload, workload_type, container) (label_replace(kube_customresource_vpa_memory_recommendation{bound=\"target\", namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, \"workload\", \"$1\", \"target_name\", \"(.*)\") * on (namespace, workload, container) group_left (workload_type) (0 * workload_container:memory_request:max_bytes + 1))" },
        { "refId": "J", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "max by (namespace, workload, workload_type, container) (label_replace(kube_customresource_vpa_memory_recommendation{bound=\"lowerBound\", namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, \"workload\", \"$1\", \"target_name\", \"(.*)\") * on (namespace, workload, container) group_left (workload_type) (0 * workload_container:memory_request:max_bytes + 1))" },
        { "refId": "K", "instant": true, "range": false, "format": "table", "expr": "max by (namespace, workload, workload_type, container) (label_replace(kube_customresource_vpa_memory_recommendation{bound=\"upperBound\", namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, \"workload\", \"$1\", \"target_name\", \"(.*)\") * on (namespace, workload, container) group_left (workload_type) (0 * workload_container:memory_request:max_bytes + 1))" }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "merge", "options": {} },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
            "indexByName": {
              "namespace": 0, "workload_type": 1, "workload": 2, "container": 3,
              "Value #A": 4, "Value #B": 5, "Value #C": 6, "Value #I": 7, "Value #J": 8,
              "Value #D": 9, "Value #E": 10, "Value #K": 11,
              "Value #F": 12, "Value #G": 13, "Value #H": 14
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "namespace": "Namespace",
              "workload_type": "Kind",
              "workload": "Workload",
              "container": "Container",
              "Value #A": "Request now",
              "Value #B": "Request by rule",
              "Value #C": "Now / rule",
              "Value #D": "Limit now",
              "Value #E": "Limit by rule",
              "Value #F": "Real memory p95",
              "Value #G": "Working set p95",
              "Value #H": "Working set peak",
              "Value #I": "VPA target",
              "Value #J": "VPA lower bound",
              "Value #K": "VPA upper bound"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "filterByValue",
          "options": {
            "type": "exclude",
            "match": "any",
            "filters": [{ "fieldName": "Request by rule", "config": { "id": "isNull", "options": {} } }]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "decimals": 0, "custom": { "align": "auto", "filterable": true } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Namespace" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "string" }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Kind" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "string" }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Workload" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "string" }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Container" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "string" }] },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Now / rule" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "none" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 2 },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              { "id": "mappings", "value": [{ "type": "special", "options": { "match": "null", "result": { "text": "-", "color": "transparent", "index": 0 } } }] },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "red", "value": null },
                    { "color": "transparent", "value": 0.8 },
                    { "color": "orange", "value": 1.5 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Now / rule", "desc": false }]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "$workload over time",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 25, "w": 24, "h": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "workload_container:memory_real:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\", workload=\"$workload\"}", "legendFormat": "{{container}} real memory" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "workload_container:memory_working_set:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\", workload=\"$workload\"}", "legendFormat": "{{container}} working set" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "workload_container:memory_request:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\", workload=\"$workload\"}", "legendFormat": "{{container}} request" },
        { "refId": "D", "expr": "workload_container:memory_limit:max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\", workload=\"$workload\"}", "legendFormat": "{{container}} limit" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0 } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".* (request|limit)$" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max", "mean"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    }
  ]
}
